  "method": "One headless Chrome page at a time; 12 seconds real-time per event, except running at 4.2 seconds before finish. measuredCadence is a fresh requestAnimationFrame observer started after assets and actors are ready; no video recorder or manual stepping. Legacy performance buckets are retained separately and may include initialization. Other user apps may remain open.",
